    "Input: token_hidden_states = [[1.0, 2.0], [3.0, 4.0]], routing_weights = [[0.7, 0.3], [0.4, 0.6]], expert_outputs = [[[10.0, 10.0], [20.0, 20.0]], [[30.0, 30.0], [40.0, 40.0]]]\n\nOutput: [[13.0, 13.0], [36.0, 36.0]]\n\nExplanation: Evaluated inference_moe_dispatch_aggregation under standard test conditions."
