  "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef inference_moe_dispatch_aggregation(token_hidden_states: list, routing_weights: list, expert_outputs: list) -> list:\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **Implement MoE Token Dispatch and Expert Aggregation** by following direct mathematical principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef inference_moe_dispatch_aggregation(token_hidden_states: list, routing_weights: list, expert_outputs: list) -> list:\n    rw = np.array(routing_weights, dtype=float)[:, :, None]\n    return np.round(np.sum(rw * np.array(expert_outputs, dtype=float), axis=1), 4).tolist()\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the size of the primary input.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
